    "formula": "Cracking moment: M_cr = 0.292 × f_t × b × h² = 0.292 × 2.01e6 × 0.2 × 0.4² = 0.292 × 2.01e6 × 0.032 = 18780 N·m; Service moment: M_s = P×a/2 = 120000×1.2/2 = 72000 N·m (four-point bending); Steel stress: σ_s = M_s/(0.87×A_s×h₀) = 72000/(0.87×6.03e-4×0.365) = 72000/1.916e-4 = 375.8 MPa; Effective reinforcement ratio: ρ_te = A_s/(0.5×b×h) = 6.03e-4/(0.5×0.2×0.4) = 0.01508; Strain non-uniformity coefficient: ψ = 1.1 - 0.65×f_tk/(ρ_te×σ_s) = 1.1 - 0.65×2.01e6/(0.01508×375.8e6) = 1.1 - 0.231 = 0.869; Crack width (GB50010): w_max = α_cr × ψ × σ_s/Es × (1.9c + 0.08d_eq/ρ_te) = 1.9 × 0.869 × 375.8e6/200e9 × (1.9×25 + 0.08×16/0.01508) = 1.9 × 0.869 × 1.879e-3 × (47.5 + 84.9) = 1.9 × 0.869 × 1.879e-3 × 132.4 = 0.413 mm; Crack spacing: l_cr = 1.9c + 0.08d_eq/ρ_te = 47.5 + 84.9 = 132.4 mm; w_max = 0.413 mm < 1.5 mm limit (satisfied)",
